'''Wolf Fur Mixin''' is a {{Rare}} [[Mixins|Mixin]] that can be brewed with a {{Item|God Potion}} to grant it an additional effect for its duration.

== Obtaining ==
=== Purchase ===
A '''Wolf Fur Mixin''' can be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Bartender}} for {{c|150k}} once the player reaches {{Coll|Wolf Slayer VIII}}.

== Usage ==
=== Brewing ===
A '''Wolf Fur Mixin''' can be brewed with a {{Item|God Potion}} to grant the player {{stat|mf|+7}} when slaying monsters in one hit. This effect lasts for the {{Item|God Potion}}'s entire duration.
